:: OC Patrick and Michael Roughhousing [nobr]

/* Intro */
You are walking over to the water fountain to grab a drink when you see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span>, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span>, and some other boys in the middle of a soccer game. <span style="color:LightGreen">Both boys are playing pretty well, both on the same team. When <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> scores a goal <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> claps and pats him on the back. Your surprised he seems normal around him.</span> <br>


