<span style="color:LightCoral">Then <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> strikes, grappling at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> as he tries to put him in a headlock.</span> But then something strange happens, <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> starts giggling even more?</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, I love playing wrestling!”</span>  He laughs, not realizing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> is trying to hurt him and instead seeing it as a game. To his credit, the boy is able to hold his own and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> struggles to keep him down, shocked by his surprising strength! <br>
<br>
<span style="color:Yellow">What started as some playful roughhousing gets more intense as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> seems actually in danger of losing!</span> Things not going as planned, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> chooses to instead use a dirty tactic, <span style="color:Pink">and you watch him grab <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span>’s bottoms and yank them down! You blush as the expected result is shown, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> big, crinkly diaper is exposed! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> looks down in confusion as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> and his goons are all stunned for a moment before they break out laughing.</span> <br>
