<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“The dude’s a fucking baby!”</span>  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> nearly keels over from laughter, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Forgot to ask your mommy to put some real underwear on you before school?”</span>  <br>

