<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Why? Because they’re great. Soft so my butt doesn’t hurt from sitting in class. Plus, they are just like normal undies, but you can pee in them. So, no wasted playtime! See!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> smiles, sticking his pelvis out. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> <span style="color:Yellow">and his goons fall silent for a moment, confused about why <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> isn’t crying in shame,</span> <span style="color:Pink">when they hear it… a gentle trinkle.</span> <br>
