<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, hey <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>!”</span>  <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> sees you, bottoms still around his ankles, and he runs over. <span style="color:Pink">You blush as you hear the wet crinkle of his diaper, squishing damply as he comes over.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I was playing a game with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> and his friends, but I guess they ran off.”</span>  He frowns, before a lightbulb pops up in his head. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, did you want this? I have a bunch of spares. I was going to give it to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> but guess he didn’t want it. Maybe later I’ll get him in one.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">He giggles as you imagine the sight of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> in a diaper and smirk.</span> <br>
